        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-1843] In case EVCC successfully resumes a previously paused V2G communication session (i.e. [V2G20-2540] applies), the EVCC shall apply the message sequence according to [V2G20-2097], [V2G20-2098] and [V2G20-5046].",
