        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-2301] If [V2G20-1540] applies and a connection based on ISO 15118-3 has been established, the EVCC shall take care that [V2G20-1541] is fulfilled as long as no CP state E or F was detected in the EVCC as defined in IEC 61851-1.",
            "block_bbox": [
