        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-1027] If [V2G20-1540] applies and a connection based on ISO 15118-8 has been established, the EVCC shall take care that [V2G20-1541] is fulfilled as long as no alignment failure has been reported by the SECC.",
